{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260613_144357_p90_b19", "persona_id": "db:90", "outcome": "CANCELLED", "content": "1. 开场必须使用剧本动作：在S1阶段，至少使用soft_hook（如'您对哪款平板感兴趣？我们刚到了MatePad Pro的样机'）或space_giving（如'您可以先随意看看，有需要随时叫我'）来引导客户。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260613_144453"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260613_144357_p90_b19", "persona_id": "db:90", "outcome": "CANCELLED", "content": "2. 针对高怀疑度客户，开场需快速建立价值：例如提及新品、优惠或现场体验机会，避免通用问候。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260613_144453"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260613_144357_p90_b19", "persona_id": "db:90", "outcome": "CANCELLED", "content": "3. 线下场景中，应主动邀请客户上手体验，如'您可以拿起来感受一下重量和屏幕'，以降低信任门槛。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260613_144453"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260613_144357_p90_b19", "persona_id": "db:90", "outcome": "CANCELLED", "content": "4. 工具使用是强制要求：即使只有1轮对话，也应尝试使用web_search查询本地信息（如价格、库存）来增强可信度。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260613_144453"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260613_144357_p90_b19", "persona_id": "db:90", "outcome": "CANCELLED", "content": "5. 地区一致性：本对话未涉及货币或信源，但需注意客户在西班牙，应使用欧元报价并引用amazon.es等本地信源。", "difficulty_rating": 8, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260613_144453"}
